{
    "title": "Photo Gallery - Album, Vault",
    "description": "<b> Photo Gallery is fast, lightweight and the home for all your photos and videos, automatically organized your photo, videos, album, GIF and easy to share. </b>Photo Gallery is designed as a smart all in one for private gallery, Gallery Vault, photo view, photo edit and photo collage maker app for managing your photo and video albums. Password-protect your photos, organize them, display them slide-show style! \r\nThis smart gallery is your new essential picture app, Gallery Album is the best application for image & video viewing that works for Android device users.\r\n\r\n<b> Automatically organized your photos & Videos</b>\r\n- Find your photos and videos faster with automatic organization. Fast refresh gallery collections.\r\n- Organized your photos and videos by creating albums, setting your favorite albums\r\n- HD browse thousands of gallery photos & Videos and use delete, copy and move to organize your gallery albums.\r\n- Folders and SD Card support. Use folders to organize photos in any way you want. Easy to Copy and transfer your photos and videos to and from SD Cards. Create albums in any of the external SD cards.\r\nPhoto Gallery helps you stay organized, so you can spend less time managing and more time enjoying pictures, and more time sharing memories with your friends or family members.\r\n\r\n<b> Gallery Lock - Hide Pictures And Videos </b>\r\nPhoto Gallery can easily hide and encrypt your photos and videos to keep secret to the secure Vault, keep your privacy absolutely safe. Lock seems like user can hide private photos like girl friend photos, hot photos, naughty photos, dirty photos, secret photos.\r\nThe hidden photos and videos won't be visible in the system gallery and all other apps. Only you can see the photos by entering the password. And grouped hidden photos and videos by folder whatever you want!\r\n\r\n<b>All-in-one Photo Editor & Photo Collage</b>\r\nPhoto Gallery has advanced photo editing suite, such as auto-enhance which will make your photos look their best with one-tap. Use intuitive and powerful photo editing tools to apply amazing photo filters, adjust lighting, stylish stickers, text, doodle, mosaic, crop, lightening, blur and so on.\r\nMake photo collage with Free style or Grid style. Just select several pictures, Photo Collage Maker will recreates a cool photo collage in seconds for you. Make & share collage photos on your Instagram story, Facebook, Twitter or Whatsapp..\r\nPhoto Gallery is not only a quick gallery, but also a powerful photo editor and photo collage maker. \r\n\r\n<b>Features for Photo Gallery, Private Gallery , Safe Gallery, Gallery lock, Gallery Vault, HD gallery, photo editor </b>\r\n- Organize your photos and videos by date, albums automatically \r\n- HD preview and Slideshow play photos\r\n- Encrypt your private photos and videos, grouped by folder\r\n- Quick search through smart category and recommend photos\r\n- Create new albums to manage photos and videos\r\n- Sorted by date, size, name both ascending or descending\r\n- Keep deleted files in trash to retrieve in customized days\r\n- Find similar photos to manage photo storage\r\n- Stylish Stickers, Text, Doodle, Filters, Mosaic and so on\r\n- Rich Collage template and background\r\n- Move/Copy/Delete photos and videos \r\n- Rename photos or albums \r\n- Set wallpaper at any time\r\n- Browse photo or video more details\r\n- Set the wonderful photos as favorites\r\n- Share photos to social network\r\n\r\n<b>More Features:</b>\r\n- A beautiful and simple user interface. Colorful themes and modern design, transparent layered and immersive user interface.\r\n- Search photos or videos by date, location. Your photos are now searchable by when and where you take them.\r\n- This is offline gallery app. Gallery works without internet connection, and is lightning fast.\r\n\r\nPhoto Gallery is an excellent, full featured Photo gallery and photo editor. It's a great galleria, photography galleries, format galleries, collection Gallery, quick photo, videos, gif & photo album app for your mobile.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Photo Gallery is fast, lightweight and the home for all your photos and videos, automatically organized your photo, videos, album, GIF and easy to share. </b>Photo Gallery is designed as a smart all in one for private gallery, Gallery Vault, photo view, photo edit and photo collage maker app for managing your photo and video albums. Password-protect your photos, organize them, display them slide-show style! <br>This smart gallery is your new essential picture app, Gallery Album is the best application for image &amp; video viewing that works for Android device users.<br><br><b> Automatically organized your photos &amp; Videos</b><br>- Find your photos and videos faster with automatic organization. Fast refresh gallery collections.<br>- Organized your photos and videos by creating albums, setting your favorite albums<br>- HD browse thousands of gallery photos &amp; Videos and use delete, copy and move to organize your gallery albums.<br>- Folders and SD Card support. Use folders to organize photos in any way you want. Easy to Copy and transfer your photos and videos to and from SD Cards. Create albums in any of the external SD cards.<br>Photo Gallery helps you stay organized, so you can spend less time managing and more time enjoying pictures, and more time sharing memories with your friends or family members.<br><br><b> Gallery Lock - Hide Pictures And Videos </b><br>Photo Gallery can easily hide and encrypt your photos and videos to keep secret to the secure Vault, keep your privacy absolutely safe. Lock seems like user can hide private photos like girl friend photos, hot photos, naughty photos, dirty photos, secret photos.<br>The hidden photos and videos won&#39;t be visible in the system gallery and all other apps. Only you can see the photos by entering the password. And grouped hidden photos and videos by folder whatever you want!<br><br><b>All-in-one Photo Editor &amp; Photo Collage</b><br>Photo Gallery has advanced photo editing su